{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）中午11時47分，北角英皇道131號中國銀行分行職員報案，指有顧客拿來100張100元美鈔（約7.78萬港元），懷疑是假鈔票。人員到場以「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕1男1女，案件正展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為北角英皇道131號中國銀行分行。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200436869406396416132089.jpeg/RaZA4u00_2iCjbVI_MVmcsuOXBjizaHeYF2vPEpdrzw\"/><figcaption>現場為北角英皇道131號中國銀行分行。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員到場以「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕1男1女。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200436872388677632125093.jpeg/FghyUNahziXevaBAkpJjFV31Tc4W_Hi0EVQxqztUMas\"/><figcaption>人員到場以「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕1男1女。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><p>根據香港法例第200章《刑事罪行條例》第99條，在明知或相信紙幣屬偽製的情況下將其當作真品行使、付給，或交付他人意圖作真品行使、付給，最高可判處監禁14年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.628348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:15:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:26.242620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:25.884573+00:00","content_hash":"a588f2c33810fe1a9196b27976f10b30643d5dd947289be8ddbbcd0a631db52c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}